  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1476/223/backpacked_banner-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"180\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/502/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"Forge\" width=\"99\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/503/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"105\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/501/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/504/mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"需要 Framework\" width=\"222\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mrcrayfish.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/500/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 官方網站\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/MrCrayfishMinecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/499/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的 YouTube\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/336389026586165261?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;logoColor=902121\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的 Discord\"></a></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Backpacked 3.0.0 現已推出！</h1><p><del style=\"text-align:center\">預計 2026 年 1 月 21 日發布</del></p><p>我很快就會更新這個說明，抱歉 - MrCrayfish</p><p>🏘️&nbsp;<strong>社群擴充套件</strong><br><em>這些擴充套件為你帶來更多可發現的背包！</em></p><p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong>Backpacked: Shells</strong> <em>by Beast135</em> <br>(<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked-shells\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked-shells</a>)<br>新增兩種可解鎖的背包：蝸牛殼與鸚鵡螺殼<br><br><strong>Backpacked: World of Color</strong> <em>by Beast135</em> <br>(<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked-world-of-color)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked-world-of-color)</a><br>為標準背包加入各種染料顏色變體</p><p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong>MrCrayfish 的家具模組：翻新版</strong> <em>by MrCrayfish</em> <br>(<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refurbished-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refurbished-furniture</a>)<br>當此模組與 Backpacked 一起安裝時，會新增一個獨家的收納櫃背包。</p><p>🙋‍♀️ <strong>需要協助？加入官方 Discord 伺服器：</strong></p><p>留言區不適合用來尋求協助，請加入官方 Discord 伺服器。你可以獲得有關安裝與設定模組、解決崩潰問題等方面的幫助！此外，你還可以搶先獲取模組更新與開發消息（比其他地方更快）。</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/794/808/img.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"195\" height=\"28\"></a></p>",
